{#
  partials/account-badge.njk — whether an account on a third-party platform is
  still up, with the date that was established, from an account_status block
  (scripts/enrich-platform-accounts.js and the LinkedIn and GitHub checks).
  The date is printed beside the badge rather than kept in a tooltip, because
  a liveness reading means nothing without it. partials/malware-badge.njk
  carries its date the same way, and ioc-search.js builds the same markup for
  search results; change all three together.

  Usage: set `accountStatus` before including.
#}{% if accountStatus %}<span class="badge badge--{{ 'high' if accountStatus.state == 'live' else 'low' }}">{{ accountStatus.state }}</span>{% if accountStatus.checked %} <span class="ioc-result__meta">checked {{ accountStatus.checked }}</span>{% endif %}{% endif -%}
